  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。提供大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Easy Elevators 新增透過多方塊結構使用現有資源來製作電梯的功能。這讓玩家能夠瞬間且輕鬆地在大距離間上下移動。本模組高度可自訂，預設可使用<strong>鐵塊/銅塊</strong>作為基底，並使用<strong>鐵鏈/終界之末</strong>作為連接件。您也可以完全取消對連接鏈的需求。<br><br>預設電梯最小尺寸為 3x3，最大為 5x5。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的額外套件\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>elevatorBlocks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"minecraft:iron_block,minecraft:copper_block\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">視為電梯方塊的資源位置（resourcelocation）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>elevatorChains</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"minecraft:chain,minecraft:end_rod\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">視為電梯鏈條的資源位置（resourcelocation）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>minimumElevatorSize</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 3, min 1, max 33</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">電梯所需的最小尺寸。預設為 3，代表 3x3 的空間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>maximumElevatorSize</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 5, min 1, max 33</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">電梯允許的最大尺寸。預設為 5，代表 5x5 的空間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>elevatorMustBeConnectedViaChains</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">兩個鐵塊之間是否必須透過鏈條連接才能作為電梯運作。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>maximumChainlessElevatorHeight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 20, min 1, max 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當「elevatorMustBeConnectedViaChains」關閉時，電梯一次最多可以上升或下降的方塊數量。更具體地說，是模組向上和向下檢查以尋找另一個電梯方塊的方塊數。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">站在電梯多方塊上時，跳躍上升、蹲下下降：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/easy-elevators/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用預設設定時；以下任一組合均可運作：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/easy-elevators/b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
